{"name":"Winter Haven","hex":"#e1e6eb","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Winter Haven","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city in Polk County, Florida, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Winter_Haven"}],"entries":[{"title":"Winterhaven, California","blocks":[{"text":"Winterhaven is a census-designated place (CDP) in Imperial County, California. Winterhaven is 6.5 miles (10 km) east of Pilot Knob, The population was 390 at the 2020 census. It is part of the El Centro, CA Metropolitan Area. North of Interstate 8 and bordering Yuma, Arizona, the town is partly in the Fort Yuma Indian Reservation. The Colorado River marks the town's southern border."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Fort_Yuma_United_Methodist_Indian_Church%2C_Winterhaven%2C_California.jpg/330px-Fort_Yuma_United_Methodist_Indian_Church%2C_Winterhaven%2C_California.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winterhaven%2C_California"},{"title":"El Dorado Hills, California","blocks":[{"text":"El Dorado Hills is an unincorporated town and census-designated place in El Dorado County, California, United States. Located in the Greater Sacramento region of Northern California, it had a population of 50,547 at the 2020 census, up from 42,108 at the 2010 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/El_Dorado_Hills_Town_Center.jpg/330px-El_Dorado_Hills_Town_Center.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Dorado_Hills%2C_California"},{"title":"Winter","blocks":[{"text":"Winter is the coldest and darkest season of the year in temperate and polar climates. It occurs after autumn and before spring, when the hemisphere is oriented away from the Sun as a result of the tilt of Earth's axis. Different cultures define different dates as the start of winter, and some use a definition based on weather."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Winter_forest_silver.jpg/330px-Winter_forest_silver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winter"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Fair294_%2817315964489%29.jpg/500px-Fair294_%2817315964489%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Fair294_%2817315964489%29.jpg/500px-Fair294_%2817315964489%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Restaurants in the town center","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFair294_(17315964489).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Latrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Latrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Latrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Latrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Latrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Latrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Shops on Latrobe Road","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALatrobe_Rd._679_-_panoramio_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/El_Dorado_Hills_618_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-El_Dorado_Hills_618_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/El_Dorado_Hills_618_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jp